<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλθ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be healed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκύδριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					63
				</span></i>
			, cf. Arctin.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Iliup.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				3.84
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not healing, powerless to heal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Bion
					<u>Fr.</u>
					13.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>deadly, inflicting incurable wounds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.424
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
